                <pb facs="0585" n="479" xml:id="pg479"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Chargé Sleeper to the
                            Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Habana</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1906-09-14"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">September 14,
                    1906</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Sleeper says that upon receipt of the cable instructions he immediately
                    requested Captain Colwell, who had already landed force, as per telegram of the
                    13th, to withdraw it.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
